Hello!

Are there any additional functions or arguments within private_alleles() that can be used to return the number of private alleles scaled by the smallest sample size of clone-corrected data? I would like to compare private allele counts across populations with different sample sizes.

Thank you for your time and consideration.

DLW

From ud192ec4b1d416345 at groups.google.com  Fri May 11 19:12:45 2018
